### Alerts — cần device auth
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId =
@deviceToken =
@alertId = REPLACE_WITH_ALERT_UUID

### List alerts của device
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}

### Tạo alert — chọn MỘT trong: spotId | h3Cell | area{lat,lon}
### daysMask: bitmask thứ trong tuần (1=Mon..64=Sun, vd 31 = T2-T6)
### startLocal/endLocal: "HH:MM" giờ địa phương theo tz
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotId": "3f6b1f9e-8c2a-4f3e-9d1b-2a5c7e9f0b1d",
  "minScore": 80,
  "daysMask": 31,
  "startLocal": "09:00",
  "endLocal": "17:00",
  "tz": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "enabled": true
}

### Sửa alert
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/{{alertId}}
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minScore": 90,
  "enabled": false
}

### Xoá alert
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/{{alertId}}
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
